{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24927","headline":"赋得竹箭有筠 · 张仲方","name":"赋得竹箭有筠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南生绿竹，独美有筠箭。\n枝叶讵曾凋，风霜孰云变。\n偏宜林表秀，多向岁寒见。\n碧色乍葱茏，清光常蒨练。\n皮开凤彩出，节劲龙文现。\n爱此守坚贞，含歌属时彦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}